 add("5. Check the platform and personally confirm birth","Return to Identity and birth to check the platform. If globally stopped, read the affected scope and decide whether to clear it. Clearing never births or resumes others. Finally verify the name, identity, complete first-activity date, deadline, and rounds, then personally check and confirm.");
 add("6. After birth","Birth is recorded immediately and can be completed ahead of time; activity starts at the scheduled time. Waiting, active life, and ended life are distinct. No automatic extension after expiry or stop. Temporary sessions are under Status and controls; daily hours are under Hours and budgets.");
